cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these texts or translations, cite this repository by file, line ID
  and the date you consulted it, and cite the edition by Garcés Pérez and Lasch
  as the source of the transcriptions.
type: dataset
title: "Genadendal Diaries: transcriptions and English translations"
abstract: >-
  Machine-readable transcriptions of the Moravian mission diaries of
  Baviaanskloof (Genadendal), 1792 to 1805, extracted from the Zenodo edition by
  Garcés Pérez and Lasch, with new English translations made entry by entry and
  labelled by review status.
